# Filter Hz 1.3.0: scene locks on the FX track's DELAY page show hertz, and LPF follows the
# scene's HPF lock. SCENE mode, FUNC + BD opens scene 1's edit, BD held: HPF and LPF nudged
# twice each from 38 and 40. Reference checked against a link image without the module: 40, 42.
# Clears scene 1 (edit list: <CLEAR>, YES) before and after, so it leaves scene 1 empty. SCNE is
# tapped three times: mode on, edit off, mode off (edit itself opens with FUNC + BD).
name: filter-hz-scene-edit
state: changes
# FX is a toggle (pressed on the FX track it goes back to the drum track), so BD is selected first.
hold TRK
key BD
release TRK
key FX
key SRC
wait 3500
cc 20 38
cc 21 40
key SCNE
wait 300
hold FUNC
key BD
release FUNC
wait 500
key LEFT x3
key RIGHT x2
wait 300
key YES
wait 500
screen cleared
hold BD
nudge E +1
nudge E +1
nudge F +1
nudge F +1
wait 750
screen scene
expect scene == ref region 0 40 128 24
release BD
wait 300
key LEFT x3
key RIGHT x2
wait 300
key YES
wait 500
key SCNE
wait 300
key SCNE
